      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8qb",
          "text": "Some symptoms become evident right after a fall, and being able to spot them can make a real difference in how quickly and effectively you recover. These include:",
