      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s8r1",
          "text": "In some cases, it may take hours or even days for symptoms to show up. These delayed effects are often easy to overlook but can signal deeper issues. These can include:",
